<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>FRIED NOODLE — Sensasi Mie Goreng Autentik</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; }
        body { background-color: #121212; color: #ffffff; line-height: 1.6; }
        
        /* Header & Hero */
        header { background: #1a1a1a; padding: 20px 50px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; border-bottom: 2px solid #e65100; }
        .logo { font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; color: #ff5722; letter-spacing: 2px; }
        
        .hero { text-align: center; padding: 100px 20px; background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.7), rgba(0,0,0,0.8)), url('[suspicious link removed]') center/cover; }
        .hero h1 { font-size: 48px; color: #ffab40; margin-bottom: 15px; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .hero p { font-size: 20px; color: #dddddd; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 30px; }
        
        .btn { background: #ff5722; color: #fff; padding: 14px 32px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 30px; transition: 0.3s; display: inline-block; }
        .btn:hover { background: #e65100; transform: scale(1.05); }

        /* Menu Section */
        .container { padding: 80px 20px; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }
        .section-title { font-size: 36px; color: #ff5722; margin-bottom: 40px; }
        
        .menu-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 30px; }
        .menu-card { background: #1e1e1e; padding: 25px; border-radius: 15px; border: 1px solid #333; transition: 0.3s; }
        .menu-card:hover { border-color: #ff5722; transform: translateY(-5px); }
        .menu-card h3 { color: #ffab40; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .menu-card p { color: #aaa; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .price { font-size: 22px; font-weight: bold; color: #fff; }

        /* Footer */
        footer { background: #0a0a0a; text-align: center; padding: 30px; color: #777; border-top: 1px solid #222; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="logo">FRIED NOODLE 🍜</div>
        <a href="#pemesanan" class="btn">Pesan Sekarang</a>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
        <h1>Sensasi Mie Goreng Autentik</h1>
        <p>Aroma sangrai wajan yang menggoda dengan paduan bumbu rempah rahasia. Rasakan kelezatan di setiap gigitan!</p>
        <a href="#menu" class="btn">Lihat Menu Favorit</a>
    </section>

    <section class="container" id="menu">
        <h2 class="section-title">Menu Unggulan Kami</h2>
        <div class="menu-grid">
            <div class="menu-card">
                <h3>Fried Noodle Special</h3>
                <p>Mie goreng telur lumer dengan toping ayam suwir renyah dan acar segar.</p>
                <div class="price">Rp 25.000</div>
            </div>
            <div class="menu-card">
                <h3>Fried Noodle Pedas Nampol</h3>
                <p>Racikan minyak cabai pilihan dengan level pedas yang memanjakan lidah.</p>
                <div class="price">Rp 28.000</div>
            </div>
            <div class="menu-card">
                <h3>Fried Noodle Seafood Glow</h3>
                <p>Kombinasi udang dan cumi segar disangrai manis gurih sempurna.</p>
                <div class="price">Rp 35.000</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer id="pemesanan">
        <p>&copy; 2026 FRIED NOODLE. Dibuat dengan Bumbu Pilihan & GitHub Pages.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
